{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10007_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:085ad4512fd55ba59f591d0d51b3ff98dd51dd40beb7cc07df2193235b1ad690",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dd417c988b3477eb5364a80c68f530661f641c54597f23ac7f80fb42d5c8af5",
      "text": "碰头会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccf3599298005c82ff64cd4de57d38dddb80772af92655440327326a0443261",
      "text": "……总而言之呢，就是希望Altessimo能来上我们的\n歌唱节目唱两首。曲目是这几首！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508",
      "text": "这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f58021fa92f31714f0cc31466f32d9fa166dcaec2afb9e725f90e9407539d84",
      "text": "（《The 1st Movement》，和人气艺人的热门歌曲卡拉OK？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cf4a08bb4c749673187b6c5988969afd6304647ab67a078c940e405db011b8c",
      "text": "（选《The 1st Movement》是看中知名度吧。\n但是，另一首是……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb14df767a3d8073fe072e4d82fd2dd7738e09b9737a96e17688419f3db3cf10",
      "text": "恕我冒昧，这里面没有我们的新歌。\n不能让我们演唱那一首吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7adc8abc8f83ddd2caf25d2f5735402bacff624e887e4b608ae95b8d213a5d59",
      "text": "新歌也是非常优秀的作品。\n请务必让我们在贵节目中演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49ee5aeb1c01d405d1438e79cca8f7042fec602b51dc4977350bf78c75bb0cac",
      "text": "嗯，CD也带来了。\n阁下，请把那份资料拿出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b327c6992e482cc13be77c83fddc19a166b641ff66ec5f664ed2558e5d3858eb",
      "text": "……我说啊～，你们听好了好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22fb332b5f17f8695052b4c80121758a4468a8eff357a98a3e48f19b9540cb9e",
      "text": "观众想听的可不是听都没听过、不知道是什么的歌，\n而是“经典的当红歌曲”啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
